Krea2FactorAuthGoogleSetupEntityNoteText = These OAuth credentials are shared by all entities and stored in entity %s. Configure them once in that entity; secondary entities reuse the same client ID and secret.
Krea2FactorAuthGoogleSetupHttpsWarning = Google OAuth web clients normally require a public HTTPS redirect URI in production. Verify the Dolibarr public URL before creating the Google OAuth client.
