Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureLogin = Hybrid login enforcement
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureLoginText = Delegates the password check to configured Dolibarr authentication providers, then enforces TOTP only after the primary credentials are accepted.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureEnrollment = User enrollment
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureEnrollmentText = Adds a native user-card enrollment panel with QR code generation, six-digit code verification, and global enrollment state across entities.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeaturePolicy = Super administrator policy
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeaturePolicyText = Allows super administrators to reset enrollment, require mandatory setup, lock or unlock login, and keep managed users visible after policy changes.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureMulticompany = Multicompany behavior
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureMulticompanyText = Stores enrollment and policy state globally per user while allowing module activation scope to be managed globally or independently per entity.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureLoginUi = Login experience
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureLoginUiText = Provides module-branded login styling and split six-digit TOTP inputs while preserving Dolibarr's authentication form.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureRecovery = Recovery handling
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureRecoveryText = Prevents normal users from disabling 2FA after enrollment and reserves recovery disable/reset controls for super administrators.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlAuth = KREA2FACTORAUTH_PRIMARY_AUTH_MODES
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlAuthText = Comma-separated authentication providers used for the primary password check before TOTP verification.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlIssuer = KREA2FACTORAUTH_ISSUER
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlIssuerText = Issuer name shown inside authenticator applications.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlWindow = KREA2FACTORAUTH_CODE_WINDOW
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlWindowText = Accepted TOTP time-window drift, capped by the module for predictable verification.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlNonWeb = KREA2FACTORAUTH_ENFORCE_NON_WEB
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlNonWebText = Controls whether API, DAV, and web-service authentication contexts require TOTP.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlOptional = KREA2FACTORAUTH_ENROLLMENT_PROMPT_MODE
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlOptionalText = Controls whether unenrolled users see an optional modal, are forced to the setup page, or receive no enrollment prompt.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlSelfReset = KREA2FACTORAUTH_ALLOW_SELF_RESET
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlSelfResetText = Allows or blocks self-service regeneration of a pending enrollment secret before activation.

Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureGoogle = Google login integration
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureGoogleText = Integrates Dolibarr-native Google OAuth as a primary identity check, then applies module domain, user-card email, and lock-policy gates.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureManagedUsers = Managed users overview
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureManagedUsersText = Lists all users visible in the current entity scope with Dolibarr-style filters for login, name, status, local 2FA policy, and Google 2FA configuration.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureExceptions = Explicit 2FA exceptions
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureExceptionsText = Allows super administrators to exempt selected users, including enrolled accounts, while generating a Dolibarr-rule password and invalidating active sessions.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureTotpProtection = TOTP attempt protection
Krea2FactorAuthAboutFeatureTotpProtectionText = Tracks failed TOTP attempts persistently, applies a lockout window, and rejects replay of the last accepted TOTP time step.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlActivationScope = KREA2FACTORAUTH_ACTIVATION_SCOPE
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlActivationScopeText = Defines whether module activation is shared globally or evaluated independently per entity.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleEnabled = KREA2FACTORAUTH_GOOGLE_LOGIN_ENABLED
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleEnabledText = Enables Dolibarr-native Google OAuth as a primary login method governed by the module policy.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleDomains = KREA2FACTORAUTH_GOOGLE_LOGIN_ALLOWED_DOMAINS
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleDomainsText = Restricts Google login to configured email domains.
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleUserEmail = KREA2FACTORAUTH_GOOGLE_LOGIN_USE_EXTRAFIELD_EMAIL
Krea2FactorAuthAboutControlGoogleUserEmailText = Requires Google login to match the module-owned user-card Google login email field.

