Krea2FactorAuthDisablePasswordExpirationGoogleRequiredConfirmText = This user has no active local TOTP setup and no configured user Google 2FA email. Because local TOTP enrollment is inactive, password expiration cannot be disabled until a Google 2FA email is configured for this user.
